Package: readfiscalau
Title: Versioned Australian Commonwealth Fiscal Data and Documents
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: c( person(given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro", role = c("aut",
        "cre", "cph"), email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com") )
Description: Discovers, snapshots, and parses selected Australian
        Commonwealth fiscal releases from the Australian Treasury,
        Department of Finance, and Parliamentary Budget Office,
        preserving publication-vintage, accounting, and source
        provenance with each observation. It provides
        offline-replayable readers for Budget, MYEFO, Final Budget
        Outcome, monthly financial, and PBO historical data and PBO
        historical forecast vintages, stores exact source bytes in a
        bounded, hash-addressed cache, and uses credential-free HTTPS
        transport. A bundled static snapshot exposes canonical series
        and complete tables for selected Budget and MYEFO families from
        2000-01 onward without runtime PDF parsing, including pinned
        Treasury chart-data CSV/ZIP members where available. It also
        inventories official Australian Government Budget documents and
        can preserve them in a separate append-only, content-addressed
        archive.
